  (:id "t-au-starttails-serve" :type :task :title "Replay ServeBlockCache start-point retention, window holds and pruning against the StartTails rules" :state :done :evidence ("specs/ServeCacheTrace.tla" "src/serve/block_cache/trace.rs" "scripts/check-serve-cache-traces.sh") :severity "high" :audit "U17" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. The StartTails trace check still binds BlockBook, which only tests use (blockbook.rs:431-586). ServeBlockCache's start-point, window-hold and prune logic has no trace check (block_cache.rs:7). ServeCacheTrace checks real ServeBlockCache snapshots at serving operation boundaries. The 25-state CPU trace passed TLC. Dropping a retained window block or skipping decode window pruning produced the expected invariant violations. Findings: U17.")
  (:id "t-au-prefixtree-serve" :type :task :title "Replay and mutate the EntryTree path used by serve, including handle refresh and pruning" :state :done :evidence ("specs/ServeCacheTrace.tla" "src/serve/block_cache/trace.rs" "scripts/check-serve-cache-traces.sh") :severity "high" :audit "U21" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. PrefixTreeTrace and its mutants still bind only LiveTree (src/prefix.rs:443, walk at :1026); serve's EntryTree path in src/serve/block_cache.rs:289,1306-1324 has no trace binding. ServeCacheTrace checks the real EntryTree path in ServeBlockCache. The 25-state CPU trace passed TLC. Skipping handle refresh or release pruning, matching the entire prompt, and preferring a shallower checkpoint each produced the expected invariant violation. Findings: U21.")
  (:id "t-au-serve-mutants" :type :task :title "The trace-gate mutants are planted in code inky serve computes with, and each turns its gate red" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/049ca079e342489855627b55a8671d1508df659b" "scripts/check-serve-ownership-traces.sh" "scripts/serve-ownership-traces.rs" "src/serve/block_cache.rs" "src/prefix.rs" "src/spill.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/124") :severity "medium" :audit "U50" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. check-cache-traces.sh:120-153,165 calls seven mutants 'production mutations', but none changes code that inky serve runs: cache_scheduler.rs, reissue only via BlockBook, and byte_offset's unused stored offset. Findings: U50.")
  (:id "t-au-window-rule" :type :task :title "The models keep the window rule the server prunes by, and the WindowOffByOne witness reports a real off-by-one" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/BlockLayout.tla" "specs/SlotOverlap.cfg" "src/serve/block_cache.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U55" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. src/serve/block_cache.rs:100 prunes keeping W-1 positions (EXT-1) while specs/BlockLayout.tla:54,193 require the last W; at next_pos=1087 production drops block 0 the model requires. Findings: U55.")
  (:id "t-au-multiblock-span" :type :task :title "CacheScheduler models spans that cross block boundaries, as every production prefill chunk does" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/CacheScheduler.tla" "specs/CacheSchedulerMultiBlockSpan.cfg" "src/cache_scheduler.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U56" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. specs/CacheScheduler.tla:38,560-566 keep every span inside one block; multi-block prefill (block_cache.rs:1215,1269, chunk 4096) has no model and CACHE_SCHEDULER.md:137-143 omits the limit. Findings: U56.")
  (:id "t-au-start-state" :type :task :title "CacheScheduler models a start point's recurrent state with its own tier and budget, so StartPointsKept can fail" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/CacheScheduler.tla" "specs/CacheSchedulerMaxPos8.cfg" "specs/StartStateDropped.cfg" "src/cache_scheduler.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U57" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. specs/CacheScheduler.tla:920-923 stateKept clause cannot fail since every write (:100-105, :737-743) sets it with kept; recurrent state spill/restore is unmodelled. Findings: U57.")
  (:id "t-au-decode-seal" :type :task :title "The model and the scheduler twin never seal decode-written blocks or keep start points on them, as decision 4 says" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/CacheScheduler.tla" "specs/DecodeBlockSealed.cfg" "src/cache_scheduler.rs" "src/scheduler.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U58" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. specs/CacheScheduler.tla:697,737-743 still seal decode-written blocks and keep start points there; :408 restores up to target, contradicting DESIGN.md decision 4. Findings: U58.")
  (:id "t-au-bypass-ghost" :type :task :title "BypassBoundHolds counts pass-overs with an independent ghost counter and is checked at a bypass bound above 1" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/CacheScheduler.tla" "specs/CacheSchedulerBypass2.cfg" "src/cache_scheduler.rs" "src/scheduler.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U59" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. specs/CacheScheduler.tla:960-962 BypassBoundHolds checks the actions' own waitTicks (no independent ghost counter), and every .cfg still sets MaxBypass = 1 (e.g. specs/CacheScheduler.cfg:15). Findings: U59.")
  (:id "t-au-writeback-guard" :type :task :title "BuildStep waits for an in-flight cold writeback in the model as in the code, so the block keeps its I/O protection" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/CacheScheduler.tla" "specs/WritebackClobbered.cfg" "src/cache_scheduler.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U61" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. specs/CacheScheduler.tla:568-644 BuildStep has no stepIO = {} guard and sets stepIO' = pendIO ({} without the bug), silently dropping a pending cold writeback from StartColdWriteback (:485-494). Findings: U61.")
  (:id "t-au-spillable" :type :task :title "ColdBlocksSpillable states a spillability condition that a model which never spills would fail" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/CacheScheduler.tla" "specs/SpillDisabled.cfg" "specs/run_cache_scheduler.sh" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U62" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. specs/CacheScheduler.tla:949-958 ColdBlocksSpillable's spillability disjunction (refCount = 0 or StartReferrers # {}) is always true under RefCountMatchesReferrers, so it asserts nothing about spilling. Findings: U62.")
  (:id "t-au-inblock-kernels" :type :task :title "The in-block address arithmetic the Metal kernels run is bound to the InBlock model by trace or test" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/InBlockTrace.tla" "specs/InBlockTraceData.tla" "src/blocks.rs: key_row_at" "src/kernels.metal: kv_blk_ptr" "src/prefill.metal: kv_blk_ptr" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U63" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. InBlockTrace binds only key_row_at (src/blocks.rs:203), reached in production only via dead src/engine.rs:826-827; the Metal in-slot address macros (kernels.metal, prefill.metal) are bound to no trace. Findings: U63.")
  (:id "t-au-trace-actions" :type :task :title "Trace replay checks each step's named action and arguments, so a step that changes nothing is refused" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "src/cache_trace.rs" "src/scheduler.rs" "scripts/check-cache-traces.sh" "scripts/check-scheduler-traces.sh" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U68" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. Rendered TLA traces drop step.action/args and Conforms == Init / [][Next]_vars (src/cache_trace.rs:1386,2410) accepts no-op steps as stutters, so a restore_block that sets nothing passes. Findings: U68.")
  (:id "t-au-engine-models" :type :task :title "The kv-disk tier, the sliding-window ring and prefill scratch, rollback_verify and VecAlloc each have a state or layout model" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/VecAlloc.tla" "specs/VerifyRollback.tla" "specs/KvDiskTier.tla" "specs/SwaRing.tla" "src/engine.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U69" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. No TLA+ state or layout model covers the --kv-disk tier, sliding-window ring/scratch, rollback_verify or VecAlloc (src/engine.rs:58-87, 468, 2329-2408, 3218-3548). Findings: U69.")
  (:id "t-au-blockedslab-model" :type :task :title "BlockedSlab slot reuse, stride growth and the packed block-table upload have a layout model run at capacity 3 or 4" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/BlockedSlab.tla" "specs/BlockedSlab3.cfg" "specs/BlockedSlab4.cfg" "specs/BlockedSlabFlatGrow.cfg" "specs/BlockedSlabNoReuseZero.cfg" "specs/BlockedSlabMissedDirty.cfg" "src/engine/tests.rs: blocked_slab_alloc_reuse_zero_fill_and_strided_growth" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U70" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. BlockedSlab slot reuse, stride re-layout and (slot*2+swa)*stride base (src/engine.rs:531-654) and the dirty-range upload (src/blocks.rs:847-933) still have no layout model and alloc_slot no test. Findings: U70.")
  (:id "t-au-slab-word" :type :task :title "The slab-packed GPU block-table word has a layout model and a multi-slab test of packing, shader decode and bind order" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/6e522e93ec74f674f656da909a27d79ddd14e4df" "specs/SlabWord.tla" "specs/SlabWord.cfg" "specs/SlabWordKv8.cfg" "specs/SlabWordUnmasked.cfg" "specs/SlabWordWrongBind.cfg" "specs/SlabWordOverflow.cfg" "specs/SlabWordFifthSlab.cfg" "src/blocks.rs: multi_slab_gpu_table_entry_packs_all_four_slabs_decodes_shader_ptr_and_refuses_overflow" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/114") :severity "medium" :audit "U18" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. The packed word (slab<<62)/offset at src/blocks.rs:631-642 and its decode at kernels.metal:1264 have no layout model, trace, or multi-slab test; BlockLayout.tla still checks only flat offsets. Findings: U18.")
  (:id "audit-gates" :type :roadmap :title "Rowan's audit: gates and tests"
   :rows (
     ("au-l4-lifecycle" "Lanes in inky serve pass through Queued, Admitted and Restoring, and the Layer 4 rows cite tests of the serving path")
     ("au-loopcd-gpu-gate" "A GPU gate runs LoopCD, the dry weak pass, k_loopcd_blend and a mixed-omega batch, with a planted-bug control ([#86](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/86), [#106](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/106), [#110](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/110))")
     ("au-replay-real" "The replay set is real fleet card traffic, and the lane-count knee is derived from it")
     ("au-blocked-invariance" "Batch-invariance gates run the blocked kernels inky serve uses, past 17 lanes, past 1024 positions and at full-size spans ([#110](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/110))")
     ("au-servecheck-server-fault" "servecheck's negative controls plant a fault in the server, so each one shows a probe going red on a real server bug ([#109](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/109))")
     ("au-poison-writes" "The poisoned-slot gate checks poisoned and saved slots after each step, catching stray writes as well as reads ([#110](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/110))")
     ("au-serve-conn-tests" "Tests drive the serve connection handler with chunked, oversized, unauthenticated, slow and over-cap requests ([#111](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/111))")
     ("au-serve-fake-time" "Admission and handler unit tests run on an injected clock, with no sleeps or wall-clock assertions ([#111](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/111))")
     ("au-faults-records" "The full-disk and kill steps read the record files back and fail on a torn line ([#111](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/111))")
     ("au-soak-nightly" "The soak and fault gates run in a blocking nightly, and the soak fails on 429s under capacity and on a wired limit that never moved")
     ("au-gpu-sabotage" "Every GPU gate in ci.sh has a planted-bug control that CI requires to fail ([#113](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/113))")
   )
   :columns (("done" "done"))
   :cells (
     ("au-l4-lifecycle" "done" "t-au-l4-lifecycle")
     ("au-loopcd-gpu-gate" "done" "t-au-loopcd-gpu-gate")
     ("au-replay-real" "done" "t-au-replay-real")
     ("au-blocked-invariance" "done" "t-au-blocked-invariance")
     ("au-servecheck-server-fault" "done" "t-au-servecheck-server-fault")
     ("au-poison-writes" "done" "t-au-poison-writes")
     ("au-serve-conn-tests" "done" "t-au-serve-conn-tests")
     ("au-serve-fake-time" "done" "t-au-serve-fake-time")
     ("au-faults-records" "done" "t-au-faults-records")
     ("au-soak-nightly" "done" "t-au-soak-nightly")
     ("au-gpu-sabotage" "done" "t-au-gpu-sabotage")
   ))
  (:id "t-au-l4-lifecycle" :type :task :title "Lanes in inky serve pass through Queued, Admitted and Restoring, and the Layer 4 rows cite tests of the serving path" :state :done :evidence ("src/serve.rs: scheduler, serve_layer3_three_turn_10k_cached_matches_cold_solo" "src/serve.rs: serve_lane_is_not_runnable_before_restore_finishes") :severity "high" :audit "U9" :note "The serving queue owns the Queued request until admission passes. Its physical lane enters Admitted and Restoring before becoming Ready. The 10K Metal serving test asserts these transitions for cold and cached requests.")
  (:id "t-au-loopcd-gpu-gate" :type :task :title "A GPU gate runs LoopCD, the dry weak pass, k_loopcd_blend and a mixed-omega batch, with a planted-bug control" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/bfd19bfcb2b2459a0fb951ebd491fa5c1f79549b" "src/kernels.metal: k_loopcd_blend" "src/engine.rs: loopcd_blend_row, span_loopcd" "src/main.rs: loopcdgate, weak_loopcd_mismatch" "src/loopcd_tests.rs" "tests/ci.sh" "tests/loopcd-gate.sh" ".github/workflows/nightly.yml" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/86" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/106" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/110" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/121" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/122") :severity "high" :audit "U19" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. No gate ran GPU LoopCD on main. Findings: U19. inky loopcdgate runs on PR CI across a mixed-omega blocked batch, checking both the dry-probe and standalone 1-pass weak-logit references, k_loopcd_blend against an independent CPU oracle, KV/CS preservation, and INK_LOOPCDGATE_SABOTAGE=1. Nightly tests/loopcd-gate.sh also runs the CLI first-token and paged mixed-lane model fixtures and requires INKY_TEST_LOOPCD_WRITE_WEAK_STATE=1 to fail.")
  (:id "t-au-replay-real" :type :task :title "The replay set is real fleet card traffic, and the lane-count knee is derived from it" :state :todo :evidence ("tests/replay/recorded_cards.jsonl" "docs/LANE-SWEEP.md" "docs/ROADMAP.md") :severity "high" :audit "U34" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. docs/LANE-SWEEP.md:3,28 and docs/ROADMAP.md:365 still call the scripted, canned-tool-result tests/replay/recorded_cards.jsonl real card traffic. Findings: U34.")
  (:id "t-au-blocked-invariance" :type :task :title "Batch-invariance gates run the blocked kernels inky serve uses, past 17 lanes, past 1024 positions and at full-size spans" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/bfd19bfcb2b2459a0fb951ebd491fa5c1f79549b" "src/main.rs: blockedinv" "tests/ci.sh" "tests/nightly.sh" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/110") :severity "medium" :audit "U79" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. Invariance gates (tests/ci.sh:42-44,56; src/main.rs:788,857-871,906,1421) still use Lane::new; serve's blocked kernels are gated only by poolgate (3 lanes CI, 17 nightly, nightly.sh:11). Findings: U79.")
  (:id "t-au-servecheck-server-fault" :type :task :title "servecheck's negative controls plant a fault in the server, so each one shows a probe going red on a real server bug" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/760247a45bb6c90abd8b30ba2905acebcc82cf76" "src/serve.rs" "tests/serve-negative.sh" "tests/servecheck/main.go" "tests/servecheck/validation.go" "tests/servecheck/gate.go" "tests/servecheck/servecheck_test.go" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/109") :severity "medium" :audit "U115" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. All four sabotages still mutate client-side observations (validation.go:180-185,254-259; gate.go:300-307,457-460); none plants a server fault such as a leaked permit or a missed cancel. Findings: U115.")
  (:id "t-au-poison-writes" :type :task :title "The poisoned-slot gate checks poisoned and saved slots after each step, catching stray writes as well as reads" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/bfd19bfcb2b2459a0fb951ebd491fa5c1f79549b" "src/poolgate.rs: poisoned, restore_catches_stray_write_to_unreferenced_poisoned_slot, restore_catches_stray_write_to_non_stepping_lanes_saved_slot_before_overwrite" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/110") :severity "medium" :audit "U83" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. poolgate.rs:171-177: restore overwrites saved slots without checking that poisoned slots still hold POISON, so a step that writes into another lane's slot still passes the gate. Findings: U83.")
  (:id "t-au-serve-conn-tests" :type :task :title "Tests drive the serve connection handler with chunked, oversized, unauthenticated, slow and over-cap requests" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/e07a9410980b50c7ba83dcf7e42ce6fc625413c6" "src/serve.rs: try_acquire_conn_slot, handle_connection, serve_one_connection" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/111") :severity "medium" :audit "U101" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. The serve() connection closure (src/serve.rs:2614-2690) still has no test for chunked/413/unauthenticated-body/slow-read/MAX_CONNS paths; moving the body read above check_headers (2636) would pass every gate. Findings: U101.")
  (:id "t-au-serve-fake-time" :type :task :title "Admission and handler unit tests run on an injected clock, with no sleeps or wall-clock assertions" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/e07a9410980b50c7ba83dcf7e42ce6fc625413c6" "src/serve.rs: ServeClock, FakeServeClock" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/111") :severity "medium" :audit "U95" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. Admission and handler unit tests still run on real time: sleeps and wall-clock bounds at src/serve.rs:3878-3882, 3919, 3956-3958 and recv_timeout(5 s) at 3293 and later. Findings: U95.")
  (:id "t-au-faults-records" :type :task :title "The full-disk and kill steps read the record files back and fail on a torn line" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/e07a9410980b50c7ba83dcf7e42ce6fc625413c6" "src/record.rs: repair_torn_jsonl_file" "tests/soak_faults.sh" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/111") :severity "medium" :audit "U122" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. src/record.rs:520 still writes line+newline to an unbuffered File with no torn-tail repair, and tests/soak_faults.sh full-disk/SIGKILL steps never read record files. Findings: U122.")
  (:id "t-au-soak-nightly" :type :task :title "The soak and fault gates run in a blocking nightly, and the soak fails on 429s under capacity and on a wired limit that never moved" :state :todo :evidence ("tests/soak.sh") :severity "medium" :audit "U117" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. No workflow runs tests/soak.sh or soak_faults.sh (ci.yml:47-48, nightly.yml); soak verdict ignores http_429 (soak_client.go:763-765); check_wired_limit passes if limit never moved (soak.sh:299). Findings: U117.")
  (:id "t-au-gpu-sabotage" :type :task :title "Every GPU gate in ci.sh has a planted-bug control that CI requires to fail" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/dff0447f031092447249d567ce0c11cde3d8d496" "src/main.rs" "tests/ci.sh" "tests/nightly.sh" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/113") :severity "low" :audit "U235" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. tests/ci.sh:42, 43, 56 run binv, lanes and dbatch with no planted-bug control, so no run shows these gates can fail. Findings: U235.")
