  (:id "t-au-runner-trust" :type :task :title "The self-hosted M5 runner runs only reviewed code from trusted triggers, as a dedicated unprivileged user" :state :todo :evidence (".github/workflows/ci.yml") :severity "high" :audit "U2, U3" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. Fork exclusion for self-hosted M5 is only the if: at .github/workflows/ci.yml:75, inside the PR-supplied file; one approval click runs fork code on the owner's runner. Findings: U2, U3.")
  (:id "t-au-dead-code" :type :task :title "Settle the dead-code candidates that are not certain: held for open pull requests, stale attributes and test-only groups" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/049ca079e342489855627b55a8671d1508df659b" "docs/DEAD-CODE.md" "tests/dead_code_ledger.rs" "src/engine.rs" "src/serve.rs" "src/record.rs" "src/main.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/124") :severity "low" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25, on main at 21966b0. With all 45 allow(dead_code) attributes stripped, cargo check --bins gives 218 warnings. A finding pass classed 44 groups: 16 to remove (code only its own unit tests call, such as decode_overwrites_prompt and record::card_id_from_headers), 4 stale attributes, 7 held for open pull requests, 7 reference implementations the trace checks run, 10 to keep. The 15 certain removals have their own rows; record::group_by_card was held because open pull request 90 edits its test. Nothing was removed. Each remaining removal needs two independent checks for users, including open pull request branches.")
  (:id "t-au-dead-d1" :type :task :title "Remove decode_overwrites_prompt and its unit test" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/16ab36742ef87a268c0c9d8788bf5f1a79046305" "src/serve.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/118") :severity "low" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25, on main at 21966b0. Dead: the compiler warns once allow(dead_code) is stripped, and two independent checks found no user on main or on any open pull request branch. src/serve.rs:791-792, test at 3481-3487. A layer 2 ring check nothing calls on main or on any open pull request branch.")
  (:id "t-au-dead-d2" :type :task :title "Remove record::card_id_from_headers and the test lines that call it" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/16ab36742ef87a268c0c9d8788bf5f1a79046305" "src/record.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/118") :severity "low" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25, on main at 21966b0. Dead: the compiler warns once allow(dead_code) is stripped, and two independent checks found no user on main or on any open pull request branch. src/record.rs:204-215, test lines 683-687 and 694. serve parses the header itself with sanitize_card_id; keep the auth-stripping part of the test.")
