  (:id "audit-docs" :type :roadmap :title "Rowan's audit: docs that disagree with the code"
   :rows (
     ("au-doc-design-starts" "DESIGN.md and the roadmap state the start-point stride and step building the server runs, one policy the model and gates share ([#113](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/113))")
     ("au-doc-design-status" "DESIGN.md's status line and layer table agree with the roadmap, and DSPARK.md cites current line numbers ([#113](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/113))")
     ("au-doc-design-agree" "tests/ci.sh and DESIGN.md describe what the long-prompt agreement check compares ([#113](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/113))")
     ("au-doc-memd-sleep" "DESIGN.md, memd.rs and MemMode.tla say what the code does when the machine sleeps ([#119](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/119))")
     ("au-doc-readme-serving" "docs/README.md documents the engine environment variables that change serving ([#119](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/119))")
     ("au-doc-roadmap-evidence" "Roadmap evidence names files and functions that exist on the path serve runs, and row states match the code ([#125](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/125))")
     ("au-doc-releases" "Release notes and the serve.rs header describe the cross-card reuse and lane states the code has ([#119](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/119))")
     ("au-doc-loopcd" "LoopCD has a roadmap row, a design section and serve documentation ([#86](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/86), [#124](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/124))")
     ("au-doc-specs" "specs/README.md, RESULTS.md and CACHE_SCHEDULER.md describe the models and runs CI has, PrefixTree and the 429 rule included ([#117](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/117))")
     ("au-doc-code-comments" "Code comments in blocks.rs, prefix.rs, engine.rs, main.rs, poolgate.rs and serve.rs describe what is wired today ([#119](https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/119))")
   )
   :columns (("done" "done"))
