  (:id "t-au-s-agreement" :type :task :title "The agreement gate checks the out-of-repo reference against the committed tokens" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/5d40df82b6aee9a44888915aa906244a6040f05e" "tests/ci.sh" "tools/ref_logits.cpp" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/116") :severity "low" :audit "U315" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. tests/ci.sh:22 uses $REF/long.tokens while ci.sh:42-56 use ref/long.tokens and nothing compares them; tools/ref_logits.cpp:14-24 still unchecked for null model/context/FILE*. Findings: U315.")
  (:id "t-au-s-tokenizer" :type :task :title "The production tokenizer's pre-splitter and Unicode tables have tests against known pieces" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/f9f658595102daf364d84add6a89398f94255b2e" "src/tokenizer.rs: piece_end, uflags" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/119") :severity "low" :audit "U109" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. No test checks the production pre-splitter piece_end (src/tokenizer.rs:93-156) or uflags tables (28-36) against known pieces or llama.cpp ids; all tests use for_test(). Findings: U109.")
  (:id "t-au-s-table-word" :type :task :title "A cleared GPU block-table entry is distinct from slot 1, and release builds validate every block of a span" :state :done :evidence ("https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/commit/4a8f00eb90f185caf0989fc62e9048d2a54e310c" "src/blocks.rs: CLEARED_GPU_TABLE_ENTRY, sync_dirty_to_slice" "src/kernels.metal: KV_CLEARED_ENTRY, kv_blk_ptr" "src/kernels.metal: KV_CLEARED_ENTRY" "src/prefill.metal: kv_blk_ptr" "src/engine.rs: sync_lane_block_table" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/115") :severity "low" :audit "U67, U340" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. A cleared entry and slab-0 slot 0 both encode as 0 (src/blocks.rs:642, ~925), and release builds check only endpoints of a span (src/engine.rs:1845-1872, full walk at 1859 is debug-only). Findings: U67, U340.")
  (:id "t-au-s-eval-evidence" :type :task :title "Each evaluation measurement row names the job or recorded run that produced it" :state :done :evidence ("docs/roadmap.sexp" "docs/ROADMAP.md" "docs/DESIGN.md" "docs/LANE-SWEEP.md" ".github/workflows/ci.yml" "tools/replay/main.go" "src/main.rs" "https://github.com/robotgamedevelopers/inky/pull/125") :severity "low" :audit "U148" :note "Rowan Claude, 2026-11-25: audit of be82ef3, re-checked on main at 21966b0. Gate row t-l6-gate-replay (roadmap.sexp:820) and t-eval-*/t-l2-profile/t-l7-* rows still rest on doc tables; no CI job runs lanebench, maxctx or a server replay (ci.yml:69-71). Findings: U148.")
